            <ArticleTitle>Rectal indomethacin for postoperative pain in orthopaedic surgery. A double-blind study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>510-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a double-blind study of the effectiveness of indomethacin suppositories in the relief of postoperative pain and the reduction in demand for opiate analgesia following orthopaedic procedures.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
